        "original_id": "984e810d-1610-5780-a022-c2cc155eef43",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Wilson, Billy Idol\n- Bands: Stiltskin, Genesis\n- Works: Live and Acoustic, Eyes Without a Face, Rebel Yell\n- Topics: musicians, albums, songs\n\nFacts:\n- Billy Idol was born as William Michael Albert Broad on 30 November 1955 and is an English musician, singer, songwriter, and actor.\n- Rebel Yell was Billy Idol's second album and was released in 1983.\n- Ray Wilson was born on 8 September 1968 and is a Scottish musician.\n- Ray Wilson was the vocalist in the post-grunge band Stiltskin.\n- Ray Wilson was a member of Genesis from 1996 to 1998.\n- Live and Acoustic is the first live CD release by Ray Wilson.\n- Eyes Without a Face is a song by Billy Idol from the album Rebel Yell.",
